Efficiency Ledger

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Efficiency Ledger is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for attributing useful versus wasted accelerator work across execution, retries, recomputation, residency, transfers, caching, fragmentation, recovery, and stranded capacity.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Efficiency Ledger does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Efficiency Ledger accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
